WEBVTT

00:03.940 --> 00:06.940
<b>Tinasha's Familiar</b>

00:19.180 --> 00:21.580
Lady Tinasha, how are you feeling...

00:24.510 --> 00:27.390
I'll cut your hair for you!

00:30.610 --> 00:34.100
Aren't you scared of a witch like me?

00:34.100 --> 00:36.340
Witches are frightening, of course.

00:36.660 --> 00:39.470
I'm familiar with the records 
of the five witches.

00:39.470 --> 00:42.810
I read that they once destroyed 
a nation in a single night.

00:42.810 --> 00:45.030
Why, that's simply terrifying!

00:46.400 --> 00:49.820
However, you don't look like you would do that.

00:49.820 --> 00:52.530
I have a very different 
impression of witches now.

00:53.130 --> 00:54.110
I see.

00:54.110 --> 00:55.800
What about you, Lady Tinasha?

00:55.800 --> 00:58.980
Are there things you're 
scared of or can't handle?

00:59.550 --> 01:01.330
Can't handle?

01:01.330 --> 01:04.060
There were a lot of things in the past,

01:04.060 --> 01:07.370
but it's all been worn away 
after living for so long.

01:08.380 --> 01:10.210
As for now...

01:10.210 --> 01:14.130
I don't like being forced into bed.

01:14.130 --> 01:15.820
What do you mean by that?

01:15.820 --> 01:18.350
Like a child being put to bed?

01:19.950 --> 01:22.530
Also, I can't handle Oscar.

01:22.530 --> 01:25.030
I can never tell what he's thinking.

01:25.540 --> 01:30.770
I think he thinks of me like a cat 
he took in off the streets.

01:32.080 --> 01:34.030
You seem to get along wonderfully.

01:34.030 --> 01:35.180
What?

01:35.180 --> 01:36.510
Wonderfully?

03:08.200 --> 03:12.960
~ What the Forest Dreams Of ~

03:16.810 --> 03:20.840
And so, Father, this is 
the Witch of the Azure Moon.

03:20.840 --> 03:22.540
I plan on taking her as my wife.

03:22.540 --> 03:23.770
Not happening!

03:23.770 --> 03:26.220
I was trying to keep quiet, 
but this nonsense again!

03:26.220 --> 03:29.180
I'm only here to lift his curse.

03:29.180 --> 03:32.190
<b>King of Farsas   Kevin    Oscar's Father</b>

03:29.480 --> 03:32.910
Will you be able to break the curse on my son?

03:33.270 --> 03:35.810
I've run into some difficulty in its analysis.

03:36.230 --> 03:38.970
It'll be some time 
before I finish deciphering it.

03:39.510 --> 03:42.460
But, well, I'll figure something out in the end.

03:42.460 --> 03:43.860
Please rest assured.

03:43.860 --> 03:46.940
If you fail, you can take full responsibility.

03:46.940 --> 03:48.450
Don't talk like that!

03:48.450 --> 03:52.560
You really need to start acting like 
the crown prince you are!

03:51.730 --> 03:54.450
They seem to be on good terms.

03:52.560 --> 03:53.970
In what way?

03:53.970 --> 03:57.660
For one, you could stop 
with the unnecessary comments!

03:54.850 --> 03:56.810
They do get along.

03:57.660 --> 03:58.420
There's more?

04:01.880 --> 04:06.720
We're lucky that she sustained a serious 
wound after defeating the demonic beast.

04:07.020 --> 04:09.180
That's how we managed to get our hands on this.

04:09.180 --> 04:12.180
You mean the Witch of the Azure Moon?

04:09.180 --> 04:12.180
<b>Valt</b>

04:09.180 --> 04:12.180
<b>Miralys</b>

04:12.180 --> 04:13.100
Yes.

04:13.100 --> 04:15.650
The strongest of the witches, 
as far as I'm aware.

04:17.500 --> 04:18.820
Well, well.

04:18.820 --> 04:20.500
What do we have here?

04:21.280 --> 04:23.850
What nation do you mages hail from?

04:24.740 --> 04:26.860
What are you doing here?

04:26.860 --> 04:31.060
I thought I'd have to clean up after 
the whelp that used to be here,

04:31.060 --> 04:33.160
but it looks like that girl took care of it.

04:33.160 --> 04:36.630
She's been searching for you for so long.

04:36.930 --> 04:38.460
I'm aware.

04:38.460 --> 04:42.590
I'll be the one to go and find her, 
when the time is right.

04:42.980 --> 04:45.050
I'm sure she'll be delighted.

04:45.550 --> 04:47.020
Delighted?

04:47.020 --> 04:48.690
Absolutely.

04:48.690 --> 04:51.270
She's wanted to see me all this time.

04:53.530 --> 04:56.850
In every history, you treat her 
with such arrogance.

04:56.850 --> 04:58.750
In every history?

04:58.750 --> 05:00.320
Whatever could you mean?

05:00.320 --> 05:02.180
It doesn't concern you.

05:03.070 --> 05:05.150
I'm nothing more than a bystander.

05:05.540 --> 05:09.540
You say that, but you appear 
to have your own designs.

05:09.970 --> 05:11.710
Nothing of importance.

05:12.430 --> 05:14.420
We help bring about events 
that should occur.

05:14.820 --> 05:17.620
That is the sole purpose of our kind.

05:17.620 --> 05:20.340
And if I refuse to let you go freely?

05:22.840 --> 05:24.180
Miralys, run!

05:27.510 --> 05:30.970
That girl is special to me.

05:31.260 --> 05:33.270
I won't allow any unnecessary meddling.

05:34.590 --> 05:35.710
Valt!

05:36.560 --> 05:38.180
Wait, Valt!

05:38.180 --> 05:42.430
No!

05:42.940 --> 05:45.940
<b>Northeastern Farsas    Byle Forest</b>

05:47.420 --> 05:49.590
So this is the forest 
where it's been happening.

05:50.140 --> 05:51.820
This place is huge.

05:52.370 --> 05:54.210
We shouldn't do this.

05:54.210 --> 05:56.880
Nine villagers have been left dead,

05:56.880 --> 05:59.330
found as dried, shriveled up bodies!

05:59.330 --> 06:03.300
That's why we need to find the 
cause as soon as we can.

06:04.700 --> 06:06.660
We really should stop!

06:06.660 --> 06:09.760
Lady Tinasha will be furious if she finds out!

06:09.760 --> 06:11.300
So it works out perfectly.

06:11.300 --> 06:14.930
She never lets me do anything 
when she's around.

06:14.930 --> 06:18.480
But she'll find out if anything 
touches my defensive barrier,

06:18.480 --> 06:21.020
so I need to dodge any attack 
that comes my way.

06:21.020 --> 06:23.270
I'd rather you just get found out...

06:28.210 --> 06:29.290
A pearl?

06:30.450 --> 06:31.440
Your Highness!

06:31.440 --> 06:33.170
There's a pearl growing here!

06:33.170 --> 06:34.790
How gullible can you be?

06:34.790 --> 06:36.250
But it really does look like...

06:40.420 --> 06:41.310
Lazar!

06:41.950 --> 06:42.840
Wh...

06:42.840 --> 06:44.800
What <i>are</i> these?!

06:44.800 --> 06:45.960
Strange plants?

06:46.330 --> 06:48.290
I-Is this what's been killing people?

06:48.290 --> 06:49.220
I see.

06:49.220 --> 06:52.070
They <i>do</i> look like they'd suck 
the moisture out of their prey.

06:54.260 --> 06:55.040
Lazar!

06:55.040 --> 06:56.580
Be good and stand back!

06:56.580 --> 06:57.850
Look, Your Highness!

06:58.310 --> 06:59.390
That's a big one.

07:06.360 --> 07:08.320
Oh no! Poison!

07:08.320 --> 07:09.900
Lazar, let's run for it!

07:20.580 --> 07:21.580
Lazar!

07:21.580 --> 07:22.590
Are you all right?!

07:23.040 --> 07:25.950
What are you doing in these woods?

07:44.990 --> 07:45.980
Lazar.

07:46.860 --> 07:48.190
How do you feel?

07:49.150 --> 07:51.570
Your Highness, am I...

07:51.570 --> 07:53.400
You'll be fine.

07:53.400 --> 07:55.030
She gave you an antidote.

07:55.030 --> 07:56.270
Who?

07:58.830 --> 08:00.200
Good morning.

08:01.340 --> 08:03.330
Th-Thank you very much.

08:04.170 --> 08:06.250
Um, who are you?

08:06.770 --> 08:07.880
Me?

08:07.880 --> 08:10.080
My name is Lucrezia,

08:10.080 --> 08:13.010
but few call me by that name.

08:13.410 --> 08:16.510
Everyone calls me the Witch 
of the Forbidden Forest.

08:20.740 --> 08:23.780
<b>Lucrezia    Witch of the Forbidden Forest</b>

08:25.290 --> 08:27.110
Is Tinasha the same as ever?

08:27.410 --> 08:28.900
You know her?

08:28.900 --> 08:29.820
Sure I do.

08:30.250 --> 08:33.380
I've known her since she became a witch.

08:34.570 --> 08:39.330
It was obvious, since she's the only one 
who could cast that defensive barrier.

08:39.330 --> 08:41.020
What is she up to now?

08:41.020 --> 08:42.940
Still hiding in that tower of hers?

08:42.940 --> 08:46.000
No, she's acting as my protector now.

08:46.000 --> 08:47.280
What?

08:47.280 --> 08:50.100
So you climbed that tower?

08:50.100 --> 08:53.470
It seemed like a real nasty challenge to me.

08:53.780 --> 08:56.740
His Highness practically 
climbed that tower alone!

08:56.740 --> 08:58.180
What, really?

08:58.560 --> 09:00.020
That's incredible.

09:00.020 --> 09:01.640
What contract did you form?

09:01.640 --> 09:04.020
Did you ask to reign over the entire world?

09:04.020 --> 09:05.490
Perhaps.

09:05.490 --> 09:08.550
His Highness wants to marry Lady Tinasha!

09:09.270 --> 09:11.440
Lazar, I swear...

09:12.940 --> 09:14.360
I see, I see.

09:14.360 --> 09:15.600
Thank you.

09:15.600 --> 09:17.600
Well, she turned me down,

09:17.600 --> 09:19.370
so she's my protector instead.

09:20.930 --> 09:22.190
I'm sorry.

09:22.630 --> 09:24.190
But I like the idea.

09:24.190 --> 09:26.330
It won't be easy, though.

09:26.650 --> 09:28.180
Not easy, you say?

09:28.900 --> 09:30.540
It'll be difficult.

09:30.540 --> 09:34.610
That prude has been 
a spirit sorcerer for so long.

09:34.610 --> 09:36.860
She's not keen to find a man.

09:36.860 --> 09:38.260
What do you mean?

09:38.610 --> 09:43.900
Among mages, spirit sorcerers 
are unique in that they must remain pure.

09:44.610 --> 09:47.100
After mingling souls while having sex,

09:47.100 --> 09:51.330
the magical power needed to perform 
spirit magic increases dramatically.

09:54.700 --> 09:59.010
I imagine that with her power, 
it'd hardly make a difference, though.

09:59.010 --> 10:02.150
It wouldn't hurt her to try marriage once.

10:07.350 --> 10:10.330
I can help you out, if you'd like.

10:10.850 --> 10:13.060
Would you like me to give you an aphrodisiac?

10:13.060 --> 10:18.490
Normal potions won't work on her, 
but the ones I make might do the trick.

10:18.890 --> 10:20.100
No, thanks.

10:21.090 --> 10:23.460
Well, in that case...

10:25.110 --> 10:28.110
How about something more 
interesting than an aphrodisiac?

10:34.910 --> 10:36.660
Oh, how scary.

10:36.660 --> 10:39.780
Unlike Tinasha, fighting's not my forte.

10:39.780 --> 10:40.820
So, spare me?

10:41.120 --> 10:42.300
We'll see about that.

10:42.300 --> 10:43.820
Y-Your Highness.

10:43.820 --> 10:48.580
She <i>did</i> save us, and we figured out 
the cause of those mysterious deaths.

10:48.580 --> 10:50.870
Let's take our leave for today.

10:50.870 --> 10:51.700
Sure.

10:52.630 --> 10:54.570
Feel free to visit anytime.

11:05.310 --> 11:08.780
Did you face any problems while I was out?

11:09.550 --> 11:11.600
N-Nothing I can think of.

11:11.600 --> 11:13.130
Not at all.

11:13.130 --> 11:14.560
I'm glad to hear that.

11:15.300 --> 11:18.520
Did you finish airing out 
your magic implements?

11:18.520 --> 11:20.280
Yes, somehow.

11:20.280 --> 11:25.170
I have many that are tricky to handle, 
so I couldn't leave it to my familiars.

11:25.170 --> 11:27.130
I'm sorry for leaving the castle.

11:27.130 --> 11:28.380
Think nothing of it.

11:28.380 --> 11:31.810
In fact, you should take breaks more often...

11:31.810 --> 11:32.970
I'm going out for a bit.

11:32.970 --> 11:34.220
Ah, sure.

11:39.230 --> 11:41.760
What? Do I have something on me?

11:42.140 --> 11:43.740
No, not really.

11:44.590 --> 11:47.470
Oscar, are you feeling well?

11:47.470 --> 11:48.860
Perfectly healthy.

11:48.860 --> 11:50.430
What's this now?

11:50.430 --> 11:51.940
Never mind, then.

12:13.500 --> 12:15.390
Good morning.

12:15.390 --> 12:17.670
Oscar, are you getting plenty of sleep?

12:18.220 --> 12:19.170
I am.

12:19.630 --> 12:21.330
I'm not tired at all.

12:24.700 --> 12:26.180
Oscar.

12:28.930 --> 12:30.350
What's wrong?

12:31.110 --> 12:32.970
No, nothing.

12:33.410 --> 12:36.210
I just felt like I almost remembered something.

12:36.210 --> 12:38.030
You're not fully awake.

12:38.030 --> 12:40.190
Please, just get some proper sleep.

12:40.190 --> 12:42.110
I said I'm sleeping fine.

12:42.550 --> 12:45.410
Why are you so concerned about my sleep?

12:45.410 --> 12:46.720
It's nothing.

12:46.720 --> 12:49.470
Just don't let it get in the way of your work.

12:52.540 --> 12:54.100
She's acting strangely.

12:57.930 --> 12:59.970
G-Good morning.

12:59.970 --> 13:01.740
Good morning.

13:01.740 --> 13:04.900
By the way, I wanted to ask you something.

13:04.900 --> 13:06.890
Wh-What is it?

13:06.890 --> 13:10.100
Has Oscar been getting enough sleep lately?

13:11.330 --> 13:12.530
Probably.

13:12.530 --> 13:15.590
He's not staying up particularly late.

13:16.060 --> 13:17.520
Really?

13:17.520 --> 13:18.770
Really.

13:18.770 --> 13:21.480
How about any recent lovers?

13:22.230 --> 13:23.360
Who are you asking about?!

13:23.360 --> 13:24.500
I mean Oscar's.

13:25.410 --> 13:26.450
None at all.

13:28.900 --> 13:30.410
No one, really?

13:30.700 --> 13:32.140
I swear, there's no one.

13:32.610 --> 13:34.540
Oh, is this jealousy?

13:34.540 --> 13:37.090
Save your nonsense for your sleep.

13:38.260 --> 13:38.930
A...

13:39.330 --> 13:41.080
A lover?!

13:41.080 --> 13:46.330
He seems unaware of it, but his life force 
has been fluctuating lately.

13:46.330 --> 13:49.890
If he has a lover, 
he should just make it public.

13:47.720 --> 13:50.720
<b>Doan    Farsas Mage</b>

13:49.890 --> 13:52.250
I thought no one would be brave enough.

13:52.250 --> 13:54.440
It's hard to imagine, really...

13:54.440 --> 13:57.480
He reeks of lingering perfume.

13:57.780 --> 13:59.850
I guess he doesn't notice it.

14:02.340 --> 14:06.250
I saw him earlier today, 
but I didn't notice any scent.

14:06.250 --> 14:07.220
What?

14:07.220 --> 14:10.700
It's really obvious when you stand next to him.

14:11.180 --> 14:11.990
Wait...

14:20.820 --> 14:22.850
Sorry, I need to go.

14:25.340 --> 14:27.400
S-So scary.

14:27.400 --> 14:29.310
Who would cheat on <i>that</i>?

14:29.730 --> 14:31.970
What was that about?

14:32.710 --> 14:33.850
Oscar!

14:34.420 --> 14:35.810
What's the matter, Tinasha?

14:36.570 --> 14:38.040
Don't give me that!

14:38.040 --> 14:41.090
Why didn't you tell me you met Lucrezia?!

14:42.050 --> 14:45.190
I kept quiet because 
I didn't think it was a big deal.

14:45.190 --> 14:46.110
Sorry.

14:46.470 --> 14:49.240
If meeting a witch is no big deal,

14:49.240 --> 14:51.700
then life would be
 nothing but trivial matters!

14:51.700 --> 14:53.740
That might be the case.

14:53.740 --> 14:56.920
Please do something about 
that stunted sense of danger!

14:56.920 --> 14:59.880
I told you that psychological 
attacks can still affect you!

14:59.880 --> 15:02.170
Having confidence is one thing,

15:02.170 --> 15:04.380
but I won't be held 
responsible if it kills you!

15:04.690 --> 15:06.010
If it kills me?

15:06.010 --> 15:08.090
Luckily, I noticed in time.

15:08.690 --> 15:11.540
This spell disguises itself 
as a lover in your dreams

15:11.540 --> 15:15.650
and gradually steals your life force 
through sexual intercourse.

15:15.650 --> 15:20.360
If it acts quickly, the victim ends up 
dying in about one week.

15:20.360 --> 15:21.150
What?

15:22.180 --> 15:25.320
You should be having erotic dreams every night.

15:25.320 --> 15:28.280
I bet they get erased from 
your memories when you wake up.

15:28.280 --> 15:30.340
How did you figure it out?

15:30.910 --> 15:32.160
The scent.

15:32.160 --> 15:37.030
You smell strongly of flowers, 
like ladies' perfume.

15:37.030 --> 15:40.290
Which is why I assumed you had a lover.

15:40.290 --> 15:41.360
I don't.

15:41.360 --> 15:43.790
Or wait, do I really smell like that?

15:44.570 --> 15:45.790
I see.

15:46.580 --> 15:50.360
It looks like I'm the only one 
who can smell it.

15:50.360 --> 15:51.820
That damn pervert.

15:52.430 --> 15:54.540
So what do we do?

15:54.540 --> 15:56.420
I'll lift the curse tonight.

15:56.420 --> 15:59.220
Your life force has already begun to flicker.

15:59.220 --> 16:03.270
Forcibly breaking the spell from 
the outside could cost you your life.

16:04.270 --> 16:05.650
Which means...

16:05.970 --> 16:08.480
We'll forcibly break it from within.

16:08.480 --> 16:10.400
We have to resort to force, huh?

16:10.400 --> 16:12.070
Just be quiet and go to sleep!

16:52.660 --> 16:53.700
Oscar.

17:12.550 --> 17:13.610
Oscar.

17:17.730 --> 17:18.810
Tinasha.

17:22.430 --> 17:23.930
How tasteless.

17:31.410 --> 17:32.570
Oscar?

17:35.150 --> 17:36.020
My hands!

17:36.800 --> 17:39.360
Oscar...

17:40.310 --> 17:42.830
Please stop...

17:45.300 --> 17:47.660
I beg you...

17:47.660 --> 17:50.000
Help me...

17:50.620 --> 17:52.010
Stop it...

17:53.150 --> 17:53.840
Stop it!

17:56.830 --> 17:57.800
Kill her.

18:13.810 --> 18:14.930
Tinasha...

18:31.430 --> 18:32.870
Good work.

18:34.110 --> 18:36.870
You got back all the life force 
she stole from you.

18:39.580 --> 18:40.630
Don't...

18:41.910 --> 18:43.820
make me kill you.

18:44.640 --> 18:46.430
That wasn't me.

18:46.720 --> 18:47.820
Even so.

18:48.640 --> 18:49.660
Why not?

18:50.210 --> 18:52.520
As long as you wield that sword,

18:53.150 --> 18:57.740
you might have to kill me in real life someday.

18:58.170 --> 18:59.970
Are you being serious?

18:59.970 --> 19:00.740
Of course.

19:03.030 --> 19:04.030
Wait!

19:04.030 --> 19:06.620
Get some good rest tonight.

19:14.270 --> 19:16.130
Lucrezia!

19:16.130 --> 19:18.050
It's been a while, Tinasha.

19:18.400 --> 19:20.980
Oh, you let your body grow?

19:20.980 --> 19:22.600
What's the big deal?!

19:22.600 --> 19:24.510
That's some sick taste you have!

19:24.510 --> 19:27.770
The real sick part is 
the way you broke that curse.

19:27.770 --> 19:30.730
I didn't think you'd make him snap your neck.

19:31.010 --> 19:34.170
It was the fastest way, 
and it made me feel better.

19:34.170 --> 19:38.200
It should be obvious 
that I made a contract with him.

19:38.200 --> 19:39.810
Why would you do that?

19:40.410 --> 19:43.660
Think of it as a little greeting 
after all this time.

19:44.000 --> 19:46.380
You almost killed someone with that greeting.

19:48.290 --> 19:49.010
Well?

19:49.010 --> 19:51.200
What did that contract holder say?

19:51.200 --> 19:54.640
He got angry because I made 
him break my neck.

19:54.640 --> 19:56.770
I mean, sure he did.

19:56.770 --> 19:58.500
Must have left a bad taste.

19:58.500 --> 20:01.840
That'd be rich from the owner of Akashia...

20:01.840 --> 20:04.060
He sure was manly, though.

20:04.060 --> 20:06.050
If you're not interested, can I have him?

20:06.050 --> 20:07.900
Go ahead, take him.

20:09.460 --> 20:11.030
No, I take that back.

20:11.030 --> 20:13.310
What, having second thoughts?

20:13.310 --> 20:17.400
No, it'd be bad to introduce 
a witch's blood is all.

20:17.400 --> 20:20.660
Oh, he's caught up 
in that whole mess, isn't he?

20:21.090 --> 20:22.990
The Witch of Silence, was it?

20:24.510 --> 20:26.700
Breaking that will take some work.

20:27.100 --> 20:28.660
Let's see...

20:30.630 --> 20:31.500
Here.

20:31.500 --> 20:32.410
Take this.

20:32.740 --> 20:33.910
My way of apologizing.

20:35.710 --> 20:37.290
His blood and sperm.

20:37.700 --> 20:40.920
I think those would be 
the most affected by the curse.

20:40.920 --> 20:42.800
You took these from him?

20:42.800 --> 20:46.880
You really should do something about 
that awful hoarding habit of yours.

20:46.880 --> 20:49.100
Aren't you a little too angry?

20:49.380 --> 20:54.330
You know, that spell wasn't meant 
to make a copy of you.

20:54.330 --> 20:57.780
All I did was have it reflect his own desires.

20:58.290 --> 21:01.180
Whose fault is it that we're 
fighting in the first place?

21:01.180 --> 21:03.180
Yours, for being so stubborn, right?

21:04.570 --> 21:06.580
