21:19.150 --> 21:19.930
Step inside.

21:26.050 --> 21:26.900
Come here.

21:33.310 --> 21:34.050
Ah...

21:48.070 --> 21:49.410
I'm sorry.

21:55.950 --> 21:57.330
Sorry...

23:35.390 --> 23:39.930
~ A Breath of Life into Image ~
